=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_7a2f — Yuki's Home-Office Week (fork of p_e5b3)

This is a fork of p_e5b3 with the midday lunch walk removed entirely. The evidence is unambiguous: jacket_yuki, dog_leash_shared, keys_yuki, and shoes_yuki were all found in the house during weekday 9–17 h looks, directly contradicting the parent's OUT_OF_HOUSE blocks at 12–13:30. The parent's four core lunch-walk claims have accumulated "against" votes with zero "for" votes. Yuki works from home at desk_b1 from roughly 9:00 to 17:30 and never leaves the house during the workday. She eats lunch at the kitchen table or by the desk.

Additional corrections from the per-object evidence: shoes_yuki sits on entry_floor_e1 (not entry_hook_e1), hat_yuki is on shoe_rack_e1 (not entry_hook_e1), wallet_yuki is on entry_floor_e1 (not entry_table_e1), and water_bottle_yuki rests at dish_rack_k1 when not in Yuki's hand at the desk. The keys_yuki OUT_OF_HOUSE block (weekday 7.5–18) is also removed; keys_yuki stays at entry_table_e1 all day.

What sets this hypothesis apart from p_e5b3: at 12:30 on a weekday, jacket_yuki is at entry_hook_e1, dog_leash_shared is at entry_hook_e1, water_bottle_yuki is at desk_b1 or dish_rack_k1, and shoes_yuki is at entry_floor_e1 — none of them are out of the house. What would refute it: finding jacket_yuki or dog_leash_shared OUT_OF_HOUSE at any weekday hour, or keys_yuki missing from entry_table_e1 during 9–17 h.

